WEBVTT

01:42.200 --> 01:43.320
What are you looking at?

01:45.000 --> 01:46.800
I… The Ye family?

01:48.880 --> 01:51.440
I'm Ye Mingyu from the escort agency,

01:52.480 --> 01:55.440
not the Ye family's Mingyu!

01:56.000 --> 01:57.120
Uncle Mingyu.

01:57.600 --> 01:59.880
No one is stopping you
from going back to the escort agency.

02:00.440 --> 02:03.080
Let go first, all right?

02:03.160 --> 02:04.240
I won't let go!

02:04.720 --> 02:06.680
I'm not leaving her.

02:07.280 --> 02:08.160
Go home.

02:08.240 --> 02:09.560
Let go.

02:09.639 --> 02:10.720
Go back.

02:10.800 --> 02:12.400
- Go home.
- Don't touch me!

02:18.880 --> 02:19.920
I'm sorry.

02:20.400 --> 02:21.480
I'm sorry.

02:23.880 --> 02:26.120
I've failed you.

02:26.200 --> 02:27.400
I've failed you.

02:27.480 --> 02:29.280
I didn't protect you.

02:29.360 --> 02:32.280
I didn't protect you!

02:34.640 --> 02:35.960
Zhenzhen.

02:36.440 --> 02:38.520
I miss you so much.

02:38.600 --> 02:40.800
Can you come back and see me just once?

02:40.880 --> 02:43.400
I think of you every day and every night.

02:43.480 --> 02:45.000
I beg you.

02:45.080 --> 02:46.160
Come see me…

02:46.760 --> 02:48.680
See me just once.

02:49.560 --> 02:50.880
Zhenzhen.

02:50.960 --> 02:52.240
Lu Ji.

03:00.120 --> 03:00.960
You…

03:04.680 --> 03:07.200
He's my third uncle.

03:07.280 --> 03:08.280
He has gone home.

03:12.080 --> 03:13.480
Good job.

03:26.880 --> 03:30.120
It has been a great day!

03:34.880 --> 03:35.800
You're…

03:36.840 --> 03:38.720
the cannon.

03:47.000 --> 03:47.880
You're drunk.

03:57.560 --> 03:59.080
Who says I'm drunk?

04:00.880 --> 04:02.040
I'm not drunk.

04:03.680 --> 04:04.760
I can't get drunk!

04:08.680 --> 04:09.920
I can't get drunk.

04:11.720 --> 04:13.320
I'm not drunk!

04:18.079 --> 04:19.760
I can't get drunk.

04:19.839 --> 04:21.600
You're almost smashed.

04:31.680 --> 04:33.160
Xiao Heng.

04:34.880 --> 04:35.720
Li.

04:44.920 --> 04:46.120
You're so handsome.

05:09.840 --> 05:11.040
How shameless.

05:15.280 --> 05:17.120
Do you know you're good-looking?

05:41.280 --> 05:42.280
Are you drunk?

05:44.840 --> 05:46.040
I'm not drunk.

05:56.840 --> 05:58.720
Xiao Heng, you're not a man.

06:00.760 --> 06:02.360
You can't even get drunk!

06:04.720 --> 06:08.400
Have you ever told the truth?

06:11.280 --> 06:12.120
What about you,

06:13.280 --> 06:14.120
Li?

06:15.240 --> 06:16.360
After all that drinking,

06:17.280 --> 06:18.760
you didn't tell the truth either.

06:20.240 --> 06:21.600
Thank you, Duke Su.

06:24.360 --> 06:25.720
Thank you, Duke Su.

06:28.720 --> 06:30.360
Thank you, Duke Su.

06:31.960 --> 06:33.400
Thank you, Duke Su.

06:34.800 --> 06:36.440
Thank you, Duke Su.

06:37.080 --> 06:37.920
Stand still.

07:06.560 --> 07:07.920
I'll take you home.

07:09.960 --> 07:10.840
Home?

07:18.120 --> 07:19.840
I no longer have a home.

07:22.240 --> 07:23.800
I advise you not to meddle with it.

07:24.800 --> 07:25.760
Otherwise,

07:26.720 --> 07:28.640
your family will fall apart
sooner or later.

07:29.320 --> 07:30.280
What a coincidence.

07:31.360 --> 07:32.520
I don't have a home either.

08:09.200 --> 08:10.920
Where did Jiang Li go?

08:11.000 --> 08:11.840
It's late.

08:13.240 --> 08:14.360
You don't know either?

08:14.440 --> 08:16.520
After her ladyship went to Mr. Ye Mingyu,

08:16.600 --> 08:18.040
she asked me to come back myself.

08:18.120 --> 08:19.480
She didn't say where she was going.

08:19.560 --> 08:20.960
How frustrating.

08:21.040 --> 08:22.160
There's a storm raging

08:22.240 --> 08:24.600
in the middle of the night
with lightning and thunder.

08:30.480 --> 08:31.600
Why aren't you worried?

08:32.480 --> 08:33.799
Are you really her maid?

08:34.960 --> 08:36.000
What's the use of worrying?

08:39.039 --> 08:40.760
Worrying really works.

08:54.720 --> 08:56.600
YE RESIDENCE

09:02.640 --> 09:03.800
- Hurry.
- My lady.

09:09.880 --> 09:10.720
She's drunk.

09:13.640 --> 09:15.840
Why did you let her drink so much?

09:15.920 --> 09:16.840
Who gave you the right?

09:16.920 --> 09:18.560
- Who are you?
- I'm her benefactor.

09:19.320 --> 09:20.320
Benefactor?

11:09.840 --> 11:10.720
Master.

11:17.320 --> 11:18.400
How are things

11:19.240 --> 11:20.200
at the base?

11:20.280 --> 11:21.520
Everything is fine.

11:21.600 --> 11:23.720
Is everything also going well
on your side?

11:23.800 --> 11:25.400
You came a little later this month.

11:41.880 --> 11:43.600
I'm just worried about you.

11:46.080 --> 11:48.000
When you escaped from the nation of Dai,

11:48.600 --> 11:50.040
you were ambushed.

11:50.600 --> 11:51.920
I brought you here

11:52.000 --> 11:55.320
and you can take charge now.

11:55.880 --> 11:58.080
If you hadn't risked your life to save me,

11:58.800 --> 12:01.320
I'd be dead by now.

12:01.400 --> 12:02.680
Other than handling

12:03.200 --> 12:04.960
the base's affairs this time,

12:06.040 --> 12:07.560
I have something for you to do.

12:07.640 --> 12:08.480
Please tell me.

12:08.960 --> 12:11.240
We have a traitor at the base.

12:11.320 --> 12:12.680
I need you to deal with it.

12:13.400 --> 12:14.400
Who is it?

12:15.960 --> 12:17.120
He's also from Dai.

12:31.320 --> 12:34.280
CHU LAN

12:40.840 --> 12:42.080
I still have your brother.

12:43.760 --> 12:46.160
Do you not care about his life anymore?

12:46.640 --> 12:48.120
I'm not sure

12:48.880 --> 12:50.200
what you mean.

12:50.280 --> 12:51.760
You've worked for me for years.

12:51.840 --> 12:53.640
I'll give you one last chance.

12:54.920 --> 12:56.200
Are you going to take my side

12:57.520 --> 12:58.920
or Duke Su's?

12:59.480 --> 13:01.720
I'll always serve you, of course.

13:01.800 --> 13:03.760
- Where are they?
- Above us.

13:03.840 --> 13:05.400
- How many are there?
- Three.

13:05.880 --> 13:06.840
Are you sure?

13:06.920 --> 13:08.800
They didn't bring
their men from the capital.

13:09.520 --> 13:11.560
They don't get along
with local authorities

13:11.640 --> 13:12.760
and have no reinforcements.

13:13.320 --> 13:14.960
What language is that?

13:17.360 --> 13:18.280
Dai Language.

13:19.200 --> 13:20.760
Do you understand what they're saying?

13:28.720 --> 13:29.560
Have some tea.

13:42.160 --> 13:43.000
Where did they go?

13:46.960 --> 13:48.320
Duke Su, since you're here,

13:48.800 --> 13:50.160
why don't you come in and sit down?

13:58.960 --> 13:59.960
It has been a while,

14:00.040 --> 14:01.600
Xiao Heng.

14:01.680 --> 14:02.880
It's him.

14:07.880 --> 14:09.040
Since you're here,

14:09.120 --> 14:10.440
you can forget about leaving tonight.

14:10.520 --> 14:12.440
Let's see if you've got what it takes

14:13.160 --> 14:14.360
to keep me here.

14:26.000 --> 14:26.840
Watch out.

15:03.240 --> 15:04.480
With your martial arts skills,

15:04.560 --> 15:06.840
you're better off singing in the brothel.

15:16.280 --> 15:18.000
You can't bear to kill her,

15:18.080 --> 15:19.320
so I'm helping you.

15:19.400 --> 15:20.280
Why?

15:23.440 --> 15:24.280
Wu Lan.

15:24.360 --> 15:25.680
Like your brother,

15:26.200 --> 15:28.120
you're just nice to look at but useless.

15:28.200 --> 15:29.680
My brother…

15:29.760 --> 15:32.280
You betrayed the organization and me.

15:32.840 --> 15:34.000
Why would I keep him alive?

15:35.000 --> 15:35.920
Go see him in hell.

15:43.920 --> 15:45.960
You're really heartless.

16:18.520 --> 16:21.000
Surely Prince Cheng knows about tonight.

16:21.080 --> 16:23.240
You don't deserve
Prince Cheng's attention.

16:31.760 --> 16:33.520
You even drank so much before seeing me.

16:33.600 --> 16:35.760
Well, you don't deserve
to be treated seriously.

17:24.400 --> 17:25.520
Five against one?

17:26.599 --> 17:28.359
As expected of Prince Cheng's subordinate.

17:28.440 --> 17:30.680
- You're sinister enough.
- All that matters is winning.

17:52.560 --> 17:55.200
- Are we going to die here today?
- What a jinx.

17:55.280 --> 17:56.360
If we die together,

17:56.920 --> 17:58.840
at least I'd have a companion.

17:58.920 --> 17:59.920
Charge!

18:21.760 --> 18:23.000
I knew you'd come.

18:23.080 --> 18:23.920
Cut the nonsense.

18:24.000 --> 18:25.240
I didn't come for you.

18:28.480 --> 18:29.920
- You want to escape?
- In your dreams.

18:31.520 --> 18:32.520
Get them.

18:42.920 --> 18:44.120
Thank you, General Biao.

18:44.200 --> 18:45.440
What general?

18:46.760 --> 18:49.240
I've paid back my favor to Xiao Minghan.

18:50.640 --> 18:51.600
Let's go!

18:59.240 --> 19:01.600
When Xiao Minghan's name is cleared,

19:02.200 --> 19:03.480
remember to invite me for drinks.

19:03.560 --> 19:04.640
It's a deal.

19:14.600 --> 19:16.120
My lord, he got away.

19:16.200 --> 19:17.960
Take the rest back for interrogation.

19:18.040 --> 19:19.040
Yes.

19:26.280 --> 19:28.640
Governor, our informant
in the black market reported

19:28.720 --> 19:30.680
that Lai Biao revealed the source.

19:32.760 --> 19:34.760
As expected
of the Jiang family's daughter.

19:35.960 --> 19:37.320
She's quite capable.

19:38.360 --> 19:40.680
She could even make Lai Biao speak.

19:42.280 --> 19:44.520
Let them go happily…

19:45.480 --> 19:47.680
- and return disappointed.
- And return disappointed.

19:58.400 --> 20:04.840
DAFENG PHARMACY

20:20.600 --> 20:21.840
Do you still feel like vomiting?

20:25.160 --> 20:26.960
I feel dizzy when I sit up.

20:27.040 --> 20:30.640
Miss, I'll make you a pot of strong tea
for your hangover.

20:33.040 --> 20:35.040
I still have a lot to do today.

20:35.760 --> 20:38.200
I don't have time
to drink your strong tea.

20:39.080 --> 20:39.920
Jiang Li.

20:40.680 --> 20:41.960
Jiang Li, are you feeling better?

20:43.120 --> 20:44.200
Let me see.

20:45.880 --> 20:46.720
I feel much better.

20:47.280 --> 20:49.000
Don't act tough.

20:49.960 --> 20:51.560
You were so drunk last night.

20:51.640 --> 20:53.240
You must feel sick today.

20:54.160 --> 20:56.200
I had someone make you
stomach-warming red bean congee

20:56.280 --> 20:57.600
and refreshing perilla drink.

20:57.680 --> 20:59.040
Thank you, Jia'er.

21:04.600 --> 21:05.880
Do you have something to ask me?

21:06.440 --> 21:10.320
What did you
and Uncle Mingyu do yesterday?

21:10.400 --> 21:11.920
We went to the black market in Luyang

21:13.040 --> 21:14.600
to investigate Tuoluo flower's buyer.

21:15.280 --> 21:17.600
If things go our way today,

21:17.680 --> 21:19.600
the Soochow brocade case
will have a result today.

21:22.040 --> 21:23.240
Then…

21:28.800 --> 21:30.920
What's this?

21:31.720 --> 21:33.400
I can't get drunk!

21:35.560 --> 21:36.800
I'm not drunk!

21:45.120 --> 21:47.120
What's this?

21:47.200 --> 21:48.600
What's this?

21:49.080 --> 21:50.560
He's just…

21:55.000 --> 21:55.880
a stranger.

21:55.960 --> 21:57.200
A stranger?

21:57.280 --> 21:59.960
Why did he tell me
that he's your benefactor?

22:00.040 --> 22:01.960
He just likes to talk nonsense.

22:02.560 --> 22:05.360
Jia'er, don't take him seriously.

22:05.440 --> 22:07.840
Didn't you say he's a stranger?

22:07.920 --> 22:09.800
Why did you seem
so familiar with each other?

22:11.560 --> 22:13.840
I'll get ready and investigate
the Tuoluo flower's origin.

22:13.920 --> 22:14.760
Wait.

22:15.560 --> 22:17.360
Can I go with you?

22:17.440 --> 22:19.440
Jiang Li, wherever you go,
bring me with you.

22:19.520 --> 22:20.880
Ms. Jia'er, we have a problem.

22:20.960 --> 22:23.000
Madam Zhuo wants to hang herself
at the government office again.

22:24.920 --> 22:25.960
Jia'er.

22:26.040 --> 22:27.640
You have to stay in Ye Residence

22:27.720 --> 22:29.160
and hold the fort.

22:42.560 --> 22:43.840
You haven't sobered up either?

22:44.520 --> 22:46.440
How did you win yesterday?

22:47.160 --> 22:49.440
I heard Lai Biao can drink a lot.

22:50.080 --> 22:52.120
No one in Luyang can drink more than him.

22:52.200 --> 22:53.360
Don't bother.

22:54.320 --> 22:55.760
He lost in the end anyway.

22:55.840 --> 22:57.560
Look at how smug you look.

22:57.640 --> 22:59.720
You look just like your mother
when she was little.

23:04.480 --> 23:05.520
Let's get down to business.

23:07.280 --> 23:10.560
Did Lai Biao eventually tell you

23:12.280 --> 23:13.320
who the buyer was?

23:15.800 --> 23:17.800
The only buyer in Luyang

23:18.640 --> 23:20.240
is Dafeng Pharmacy.

23:20.320 --> 23:21.240
Anyone there?

23:21.320 --> 23:23.200
DAFENG PHARMACY

23:23.280 --> 23:24.960
- We need to get treated.
- Stop shouting.

23:25.640 --> 23:27.760
Patients have come knocking

23:27.840 --> 23:29.040
one after another all morning,

23:29.120 --> 23:30.440
but no one opened the door.

23:30.520 --> 23:31.560
They probably went out.

23:31.640 --> 23:33.720
Where did they go?
Did they say when they'd be back?

23:33.800 --> 23:34.760
Who knows?

23:34.840 --> 23:36.160
They didn't even put up a notice.

23:36.240 --> 23:37.640
They were around yesterday.

23:37.720 --> 23:39.920
Did we alert people
when doing the challenge,

23:40.400 --> 23:41.480
so someone leaked the news?

23:41.560 --> 23:42.720
Let's go to Lai Biao again.

23:43.680 --> 23:44.560
There's no hurry.

23:45.080 --> 23:46.800
Sir, can I borrow your stool?

23:46.880 --> 23:47.960
Take it.

23:53.200 --> 23:55.200
- Check carefully.
- Be careful!

23:57.880 --> 23:59.240
- Let's go.
- Where are we going?

23:59.320 --> 24:00.320
We started working
so early in the morning.

24:00.400 --> 24:01.680
Why don't you buy me breakfast?

24:02.560 --> 24:03.960
Eat all you want. It's on me.

24:04.440 --> 24:06.080
Sir, two orders of steamed buns.

24:06.560 --> 24:07.400
Right away.

24:18.200 --> 24:19.080
Why are they here?

24:21.760 --> 24:23.440
This is bad. Shun is still in there.

24:25.040 --> 24:25.880
You…

24:27.120 --> 24:28.320
Ms. Jiang Li.

24:28.880 --> 24:30.200
What a coincidence.

24:30.280 --> 24:33.000
You brought so many men to the pharmacy
early in the morning.

24:33.080 --> 24:35.080
- Do you have a serious illness?
- I'm fine.

24:35.160 --> 24:36.760
I just heard people say

24:36.840 --> 24:38.960
that someone was killed
at Dafeng Pharmacy.

24:39.040 --> 24:40.880
As the local official,

24:40.960 --> 24:43.440
I rushed over before having time
to prepare my carriage.

24:43.520 --> 24:45.280
Are you two here

24:45.360 --> 24:47.040
because you heard the news?

24:47.840 --> 24:49.160
We're only here for steamed buns.

24:49.240 --> 24:50.840
Uncle Mingyu, sit.

24:53.920 --> 24:55.040
We got tricked.

24:55.520 --> 24:57.120
- Don't act rashly.
- Governor Tong.

24:57.200 --> 24:58.560
The eight people in the pharmacy

24:58.640 --> 24:59.760
were brutally murdered.

24:59.840 --> 25:01.000
No one survived.

25:02.000 --> 25:03.080
Eight people?

25:03.160 --> 25:04.320
Eight lives?

25:06.320 --> 25:07.960
Eight lives!

25:08.040 --> 25:09.600
My goodness. Someone wiped them out.

25:09.680 --> 25:11.040
What should we do?

25:11.120 --> 25:12.200
We also caught a suspect.

25:12.680 --> 25:13.520
Bring the person out!

25:17.080 --> 25:18.440
I really came here to buy medicine.

25:18.520 --> 25:21.280
I smelled blood from the crack in the door
and climbed over the wall to check.

25:23.360 --> 25:26.160
Who would buy medicine from the back door?
Do you think I'm stupid?

25:27.560 --> 25:28.400
Sit down.

25:29.640 --> 25:30.480
Calm down.

25:30.560 --> 25:32.640
Or not only will we fail to save Shun,

25:32.720 --> 25:34.040
but we'll also be in trouble.

25:34.120 --> 25:36.160
Who's your accomplice?

25:37.680 --> 25:38.800
I was just passing by.

25:38.880 --> 25:40.360
Ask the steamed buns seller
if you don't believe me.

25:40.440 --> 25:42.760
I knocked for so long and only went in
because no one opened the door.

25:42.840 --> 25:44.640
Take him back and interrogate him.

25:54.680 --> 25:57.840
Who would do such a thing

25:57.920 --> 26:01.680
in broad daylight in my jurisdiction?

26:02.320 --> 26:06.160
How cruel, despicable, and insane!

26:06.240 --> 26:07.640
I'm the one to blame.

26:07.720 --> 26:09.280
I'm the one to blame.

26:09.360 --> 26:10.200
Everyone,

26:10.280 --> 26:12.320
I swear on my official robe

26:12.920 --> 26:14.360
that I'll get to the bottom of this

26:15.200 --> 26:18.680
and get justice
for Dafeng Pharmacy's eight lives!

26:19.240 --> 26:21.080
- Justice!
- Justice!

26:21.160 --> 26:23.400
I swear to fight evil

26:23.480 --> 26:24.840
to the end!

26:33.560 --> 26:37.560
LUYANG

26:40.080 --> 26:41.920
Director!

26:42.560 --> 26:43.400
Director!

26:45.160 --> 26:46.040
Director.

26:47.080 --> 26:47.920
Ms. Jiang Li.

26:48.840 --> 26:51.000
The Office of Weaving and Dyeing
has concluded its investigation.

26:51.080 --> 26:52.920
We're in a hurry to return
to the capital to report it.

26:53.000 --> 26:53.920
What are you doing?

26:54.000 --> 26:56.040
We haven't found out
the Tuoluo flower's origin.

26:56.120 --> 26:57.480
Our only lead,

26:57.560 --> 26:59.560
people in the Dafeng Pharmacy,
have been massacred.

26:59.640 --> 27:01.440
Do you conclude cases so hastily?

27:01.520 --> 27:02.840
Watch your words, Ms. Jiang Li.

27:03.480 --> 27:05.200
I'm from the Office of Weaving and Dyeing.

27:05.760 --> 27:06.640
I came to Luyang

27:06.720 --> 27:08.920
to investigate the death
caused by Soochow brocades.

27:09.000 --> 27:10.520
We found out the Soochow brocades

27:10.600 --> 27:13.080
carried Tuoluo flowers,
which are highly toxic.

27:13.160 --> 27:14.400
I have no right to investigate

27:14.480 --> 27:15.920
where it came from.

27:16.000 --> 27:18.680
- But the Soochow brocades--
- Ms. Jiang.

27:18.760 --> 27:20.200
I've done my job.

27:20.680 --> 27:23.440
What you're saying are poisoning cases.

27:23.520 --> 27:25.680
You should turn it over
to the local government office.

27:26.280 --> 27:27.240
Ms. Jiang Li.

27:27.320 --> 27:29.080
Please don't make things difficult for me.

27:29.160 --> 27:31.200
- I…
- Sir, let's go.

27:34.480 --> 27:36.080
Is he leaving just like that?

27:42.240 --> 27:46.280
BINGDE HALL

27:57.480 --> 27:59.480
Could something have happened to Jiang Li?

28:07.720 --> 28:08.560
My lady.

28:11.120 --> 28:11.960
Jiang Li.

28:12.040 --> 28:13.040
How did it go?

28:20.800 --> 28:22.200
The lead is a dead end.

28:22.280 --> 28:23.240
I'm sorry.

28:24.200 --> 28:25.360
It's all right.

28:25.440 --> 28:26.800
You've already done a great job.

28:26.880 --> 28:28.160
If it weren't for you,

28:28.240 --> 28:29.080
the Ye family

28:29.160 --> 28:30.840
might not be able to hold on until now.

28:30.920 --> 28:31.920
Jiang Li.

28:32.680 --> 28:34.600
You've done all you can.

28:34.680 --> 28:36.480
We'll take it from here.

28:36.560 --> 28:37.880
Isn't it just money?

28:37.960 --> 28:39.360
I think I know

28:39.440 --> 28:40.560
how much Tong Zhiyang wants.

28:41.200 --> 28:45.000
Madam Zhuo, how is Mr. Ye doing inside?

28:45.080 --> 28:46.520
Governor Tong, please cut to the chase.

28:46.600 --> 28:48.000
I thought about it for a long time.

28:49.200 --> 28:51.280
We actually have a solution

28:51.840 --> 28:53.040
for the Soochow brocade case.

28:53.840 --> 28:54.960
What do you mean?

28:55.040 --> 28:58.960
Someone high up
appreciates Ye Shijie's talent

28:59.520 --> 29:01.280
and wants to befriend the Ye family too.

29:01.360 --> 29:04.040
It's a pity that he's so proud

29:04.120 --> 29:06.240
that he can't tolerate
being inferior to others,

29:07.080 --> 29:09.240
so the higher-ups
could only play some tricks

29:09.320 --> 29:11.680
to make your nephew understand

29:11.760 --> 29:13.520
that it's easy to break
when you're too tough.

29:14.320 --> 29:15.480
You've gone too far.

29:16.120 --> 29:17.600
Please don't say that.

29:18.160 --> 29:20.240
Madam Zhuo, you also understand

29:20.920 --> 29:23.000
that the Ye family
has been merchants for generations.

29:23.560 --> 29:26.680
But Ye Shijie has no foundation
in the capital's bureaucracy.

29:27.280 --> 29:28.680
He's lucky

29:28.760 --> 29:30.040
that someone admires his talent.

29:30.120 --> 29:32.760
It's all right
if he doesn't appreciate it.

29:33.320 --> 29:36.880
But the Ye family should know better.

29:36.960 --> 29:39.680
I'm just a woman.
I don't understand what you mean.

29:39.760 --> 29:40.760
All right.

29:41.280 --> 29:42.120
Madam Zhuo.

29:43.200 --> 29:45.520
I won't beat around the bush.

29:46.120 --> 29:47.040
I don't know

29:47.800 --> 29:49.280
why you suddenly

29:49.360 --> 29:51.880
got involved with Ms. Jiang Li

29:52.960 --> 29:54.200
and even brought

29:54.280 --> 29:56.320
the Office of Weaving
and Dyeing in through her.

29:57.760 --> 29:59.920
But no matter what you do,

30:00.000 --> 30:01.560
it'll just be all in vain.

30:02.040 --> 30:06.760
After all, I, Tong Zhiyang
am Luyang's governor.

30:06.840 --> 30:08.760
We just want the truth.

30:08.840 --> 30:11.160
Madam Zhuo, you're confused.

30:12.000 --> 30:14.600
You have the truth all along.

30:16.160 --> 30:18.480
Open your hand

30:18.560 --> 30:20.200
and the truth will come to you.

30:21.520 --> 30:22.960
Clench your hand

30:23.760 --> 30:26.040
and you'll destroy the truth.

30:26.120 --> 30:27.280
How much do you want?

30:30.360 --> 30:31.400
Ten thousand taels?

30:32.480 --> 30:33.520
One hundred thousand taels?

30:33.600 --> 30:35.800
- Gold.
- The Ye family isn't a gold mine.

30:35.880 --> 30:38.000
We can't afford that much.

30:38.560 --> 30:41.880
Madam Zhuo, think it over carefully.

30:43.160 --> 30:45.160
This is today's price.

30:45.640 --> 30:48.760
When the Ye family is desperate one day,

30:49.480 --> 30:51.400
the price will go up.

30:52.280 --> 30:54.680
As the saying goes,
never give up until you fail.

30:54.760 --> 30:56.360
As long as there's a chance of survival,

30:56.440 --> 30:57.720
the Ye family will fight for it.

30:58.440 --> 30:59.480
Your tea is too expensive.

30:59.560 --> 31:00.720
The Ye family can't afford it.

31:03.400 --> 31:05.600
He's trying to bankrupt the Ye family

31:05.680 --> 31:07.200
and cut off Shijie's retreat.

31:08.360 --> 31:09.720
We can't let him get what he wants.

31:09.800 --> 31:11.840
Aunt Zhuo, let me think of another way.

31:11.920 --> 31:13.560
How can we place the Ye family's burden

31:13.640 --> 31:15.640
on a young girl like you?

31:15.720 --> 31:17.440
Besides, any amount of money

31:17.520 --> 31:19.760
is just a worldly possession to us.

31:20.320 --> 31:21.760
But now, the Ye family…

31:21.840 --> 31:22.880
Jiang Li.

31:23.360 --> 31:25.160
Our family has been in business
for many years.

31:25.240 --> 31:26.560
What we see most is money.

31:26.640 --> 31:28.880
We've seen many families

31:28.960 --> 31:30.160
ruined by money.

31:30.760 --> 31:33.240
It's hypocritical when others say
money means nothing to them.

31:33.320 --> 31:35.800
In the Ye family, we dare to say that.

31:36.680 --> 31:38.240
So what if we're wealthy?

31:38.320 --> 31:40.000
Family matters the most.

31:40.720 --> 31:42.040
You're our family too.

31:42.600 --> 31:44.480
How could I let you bear the burden alone?

31:54.920 --> 31:56.880
I hid here secretly when I was a kid

31:57.480 --> 32:00.000
and secretly learned how the shopkeeper
bargains with customers.

32:05.120 --> 32:06.920
Father taught me
how to do accounts step by step.

32:07.880 --> 32:09.760
But the thought of Father being safe

32:11.360 --> 32:12.520
is worth it.

32:14.600 --> 32:16.280
LIZHENG HALL

32:45.080 --> 32:46.640
I'll work hard to get it back.

32:48.800 --> 32:49.640
Let's go home.

32:57.960 --> 33:00.240
SHOP FOR SALE, INTERESTED BUYERS
MAY GO INSIDE FOR DETAILS

33:03.800 --> 33:05.760
The fruits in this manor are the sweetest.

33:06.920 --> 33:08.040
Knowing my craving,

33:09.080 --> 33:11.400
my mother gave it to me as my dowry.

33:11.480 --> 33:14.680
Madam Zhuo, this is all your dowry.

33:14.760 --> 33:16.480
Why are you taking all of them out?

33:17.160 --> 33:19.440
As long as Shijie and Mingxuan are safe,

33:19.920 --> 33:21.160
I can bear to give up anything.

33:23.360 --> 33:26.520
Ms. Li, get the broker.

33:27.400 --> 33:28.480
Yes.

33:47.720 --> 33:48.680
DATONG ESCORT AGENCY

33:51.440 --> 33:53.880
- Miss, check out this fan.
- This may look run-down,

33:53.960 --> 33:56.480
but this door is made of fine mahogany.

33:56.560 --> 33:58.400
This brick was made from an official kiln.

33:59.080 --> 34:01.400
The owner needs money.

34:01.480 --> 34:04.120
Look. These are good wood.

34:05.520 --> 34:07.640
I think it's just so-so.

34:08.159 --> 34:09.600
- It's a bit old indeed.
- Uncle Mingyu.

34:09.679 --> 34:11.360
- Come here, look.
- It's old.

34:11.440 --> 34:13.679
- Are you selling the escort agency?
- Isn't this nice?

34:13.760 --> 34:16.719
I don't have any business.
What's the use of keeping it?

34:16.800 --> 34:18.480
Are you trying to raise money
for the family?

34:21.199 --> 34:22.520
Aunt Zhuo is right.

34:24.199 --> 34:25.960
To the Ye family,

34:26.040 --> 34:27.880
family is far more important
than anything else.

34:27.960 --> 34:30.679
The Ye family is in trouble now
and everyone is doing what they can.

34:30.760 --> 34:33.800
Even someone junior in seniority like you
from the capital is working hard.

34:33.880 --> 34:35.159
How can I stand by and watch?

34:36.679 --> 34:37.800
I suddenly remembered

34:38.440 --> 34:41.000
how good it was when we siblings
founded Lizheng Hall together.

34:41.679 --> 34:43.920
But my eldest brother
and his wife suddenly died

34:44.800 --> 34:46.000
and I ventured out on my own.

34:47.000 --> 34:48.760
I was young and reckless then.

34:49.719 --> 34:51.159
Who's willing to admit defeat?

34:52.840 --> 34:54.719
I couldn't swallow my pride in the end.

34:55.880 --> 34:56.719
Uncle Mingyu.

34:57.200 --> 34:58.680
It's not too late yet to go home.

34:58.760 --> 35:01.280
It's more than ten years
of resentment and anger.

35:01.360 --> 35:03.520
The gap between us is too big.
I can't go back anymore.

35:03.600 --> 35:05.040
- You can go back.
- I can't.

35:05.120 --> 35:06.200
You can.

35:12.880 --> 35:14.160
This is a deposit from the broker.

35:14.240 --> 35:16.040
There'll be more money
after the house is sold.

35:17.440 --> 35:19.400
- Help me give it to Madam Zhuo.
- No.

35:20.000 --> 35:21.680
- Give it to her.
- Give it yourself.

35:24.520 --> 35:25.600
And these…

35:27.800 --> 35:28.640
These…

35:30.120 --> 35:32.960
are what I've saved from traveling around
over the years.

35:33.040 --> 35:34.680
Not much is left after opening the agency.

35:34.760 --> 35:36.360
But these rare trinkets

35:36.440 --> 35:37.760
can fetch a good price.

35:37.840 --> 35:38.680
After I sell them,

35:39.400 --> 35:40.440
give them the money too.

35:48.080 --> 35:50.920
A song drifts over the trees to the clouds

35:51.640 --> 35:55.040
as one dances in the moonlight.

35:55.840 --> 35:56.680
What does that mean?

35:58.840 --> 35:59.720
Nothing.

36:00.280 --> 36:02.760
I just came up with an idea.

36:08.920 --> 36:12.120
Fragrant and hot freshly-steamed buns!

36:14.640 --> 36:16.160
Please enjoy your steamed buns.

36:16.840 --> 36:18.120
You said you'd buy me a meal.

36:18.920 --> 36:19.840
Is this all?

36:20.760 --> 36:22.160
You sure know how to pick a place.

36:22.240 --> 36:24.760
Don't underestimate the steamed buns.

36:25.640 --> 36:28.040
These are the best steamed buns in Luyang.

36:28.880 --> 36:31.520
The wrapper is white and fluffy
with a fresh and tender filling.

36:31.600 --> 36:34.120
Thousands of them are sold in a day.

36:38.920 --> 36:39.760
What do you think?

36:40.240 --> 36:43.560
Isn't it mouthwatering
with a delicious aroma?

36:43.640 --> 36:44.600
It's all right.

36:46.920 --> 36:48.960
Go ahead. What's the matter?

36:49.520 --> 36:50.600
Thank you…

36:55.120 --> 36:55.960
for that night.

36:56.040 --> 36:57.200
Does that mean

36:58.880 --> 37:00.680
you remember what happened

37:02.120 --> 37:03.120
that night?

37:03.920 --> 37:05.480
I only remember

37:05.560 --> 37:07.280
giving back this red cape to you.

37:07.360 --> 37:09.760
I lent you a red cape,

37:09.840 --> 37:11.200
so you're buying me steamed buns?

37:11.280 --> 37:14.280
I'm also inviting you to watch a show.

37:16.200 --> 37:17.080
I won't watch shows.

37:19.280 --> 37:20.160
Come back.

37:20.240 --> 37:23.640
PASTRIES

37:25.320 --> 37:26.200
Xiao Heng.

37:26.760 --> 37:28.800
Someone was so mad at me
for watching a show at a teahouse

37:28.880 --> 37:30.200
that she wanted me to drink to death.

37:40.920 --> 37:41.760
Tell me.

37:42.240 --> 37:43.080
What show?

37:50.680 --> 37:52.560
You've eaten the steamed bun.

37:52.640 --> 37:54.400
Shall we start the show?

38:20.400 --> 38:24.000
Mrs. Ye, what's the meaning of this?

38:24.080 --> 38:25.280
I'll be straightforward.

38:25.920 --> 38:28.400
I admit that the Ye family lost this time.

38:28.960 --> 38:31.040
This is all that the Ye family can afford.

38:31.120 --> 38:32.440
Please be magnanimous

38:32.960 --> 38:33.880
and spare us.

38:33.960 --> 38:35.280
But Mrs. Ye,

38:36.240 --> 38:38.480
I remember warning you

38:38.560 --> 38:40.080
to seal the deal as soon as possible.

38:40.880 --> 38:42.480
This price

38:43.320 --> 38:45.600
can't keep the Ye family safe.

39:08.280 --> 39:09.880
This is the key to the Ye family's vault.

39:10.600 --> 39:11.960
The Ye family's heirlooms,

39:12.040 --> 39:13.680
the last things for us to survive,

39:14.440 --> 39:15.480
are in it.

39:23.480 --> 39:24.880
I beg you

39:24.960 --> 39:26.280
to do justice to the Ye family.

39:47.640 --> 39:48.480
My lord.

39:48.560 --> 39:50.960
The house where the assassins train
was seized.

39:51.040 --> 39:52.080
But those assassins

39:52.160 --> 39:53.480
don't know where Chu Lan is.

39:54.080 --> 39:56.680
- Should we use some methods?
- There's no need.

39:57.200 --> 39:58.160
These people

39:58.240 --> 39:59.560
don't know Chu Lan's whereabouts.

40:00.040 --> 40:01.080
What should we do then?

40:01.160 --> 40:03.280
Wu Lan is dead and Chu Lan is on the run.

40:03.760 --> 40:05.080
All the leads went cold again.

40:06.880 --> 40:09.440
Is the seized house rented or purchased?

40:09.520 --> 40:10.680
It's rented.

40:10.760 --> 40:13.440
Actually, they change venues every year.
It's not fixed.

40:13.520 --> 40:14.680
Ask the landlord

40:15.600 --> 40:17.000
who paid him the rent.

40:17.080 --> 40:17.960
Yes.

40:18.960 --> 40:20.000
My lord.

40:23.200 --> 40:24.040
What's this?

40:24.120 --> 40:27.440
Ms. Jiang Li's maid
sent over some steamed buns.

40:28.000 --> 40:29.600
She said Ms. Jiang bought them for you.

40:43.520 --> 40:45.080
Where's the Surveillance Commissioner?

40:45.720 --> 40:47.720
- Urge him for Ms. Jiang Li.
- Yes.

40:50.360 --> 40:52.720
My lord, do you think
the governor will fall for it?

40:53.480 --> 40:55.880
If we can't succeed in one go,

40:55.960 --> 40:57.720
won't we be laughed at in the future?

40:57.800 --> 40:59.680
That governor is greedy and lecherous.

41:00.320 --> 41:01.600
He's also obsessed with opera

41:01.680 --> 41:03.840
and often indulges in it
with his subordinates.

41:03.920 --> 41:06.040
Ms. Jiang Li is going to hit him
where it hurts.

41:06.120 --> 41:06.960
Wait and see.

41:10.560 --> 41:11.480
It's tasty.

41:53.240 --> 41:55.600
One-tenth of the Ye family's fortune

41:57.160 --> 41:58.360
will then

41:58.440 --> 41:59.400
be yours.

42:04.440 --> 42:05.960
The Surveillance Commissioner
received a tip

42:06.040 --> 42:08.440
that the Ye family tributes
to the imperial court are withheld.

42:08.520 --> 42:09.360
Is that true?

42:10.440 --> 42:11.840
I'm Ye Mingyu.

42:11.920 --> 42:14.440
The tributes given by the Ye family
were not withheld

42:14.520 --> 42:16.120
but snatched away by Luyang's governor,

42:16.200 --> 42:17.120
Tong Zhiyang.

42:17.200 --> 42:19.320
He also imprisoned my staff, Shun,

42:19.400 --> 42:20.440
who guarded the tributes.

42:20.520 --> 42:22.120
Slandering a governor is a serious crime.

42:22.680 --> 42:23.520
Is that true?

42:23.600 --> 42:25.520
- I swear on my life.
- Lead the way.

42:26.160 --> 42:28.400
The Ye family has a batch of tributes
for His Majesty,

42:29.000 --> 42:32.000
but Luyang's governor,
Tong Zhiyang, took them.

42:32.560 --> 42:35.000
I heard the imperial court
has Surveillance Commissioners

42:35.080 --> 42:36.560
patrolling near Luyang lately.

42:37.280 --> 42:41.000
Please pass this message
to the Surveillance Commissioner.

42:41.080 --> 42:43.200
The Surveillance Commissioner
has his duties.

42:43.280 --> 42:45.840
It's not worth coming to Luyang
because of a tip.

42:45.920 --> 42:47.920
Your plan won't work.

42:48.000 --> 42:49.800
My plan won't achieve great results

42:49.880 --> 42:51.360
if I work on it myself.

42:51.440 --> 42:53.280
But if you help me,

42:53.960 --> 42:55.360
it will turn out differently.

42:56.160 --> 42:59.680
LUYANG GOVERNMENT OFFICE

43:07.040 --> 43:08.680
Look.

43:08.760 --> 43:10.280
These are the Ye family's tributes.

43:12.000 --> 43:13.120
Where's the governor?

43:15.240 --> 43:16.400
What move is this?

43:16.960 --> 43:18.680
- Offering presents from others?
- No.

43:18.760 --> 43:21.640
It's called returning the items intact.

43:22.240 --> 43:23.560
These are tributes for His Majesty

43:23.640 --> 43:25.120
that Tong Zhiyang stole.

43:25.200 --> 43:31.000
By the small window

43:31.080 --> 43:35.920
I convey my grief

43:39.440 --> 43:40.880
I received a tip

43:40.960 --> 43:43.400
and came to investigate
Luyang governor's tribute embezzlement.

43:43.480 --> 43:45.800
Governor Tong,
please answer in your official robe.

43:46.520 --> 43:48.080
Tong Zhiyang is a governor after all.

43:48.560 --> 43:50.280
He can just explain it
to the Commissioner,

43:50.360 --> 43:52.400
return the things,
and say it's a misunderstanding.

43:52.880 --> 43:54.960
It's not that difficult to resolve.

43:55.040 --> 43:56.640
It's not difficult to explain it,

43:57.760 --> 44:00.960
but the head of the Ye family
must be the one to say

44:01.040 --> 44:02.200
that he asked

44:02.280 --> 44:04.880
the governor and government office
to protect the tributes

44:04.960 --> 44:07.000
instead of Tong Zhiyang
taking them for himself.

44:07.080 --> 44:09.520
So if Tong Zhiyang wants to live,

44:09.600 --> 44:11.480
he'll have to beg the Ye family instead.

44:12.840 --> 44:14.840
Everything will be easy then.

44:14.920 --> 44:16.160
You stop while you're ahead.

44:16.760 --> 44:19.320
You draw the line just right.

44:19.880 --> 44:21.120
I learned it from you.

44:23.120 --> 44:25.960
But once Tong Zhiyang's case
is confirmed to be a misunderstanding,

44:26.040 --> 44:28.360
who do you think
will be blamed for letting

44:28.440 --> 44:31.320
the Surveillance Commissioner
come here for nothing?

44:33.080 --> 44:35.920
If you want to eat this memorable
and juicy steamed buns

44:36.000 --> 44:37.640
in the future,

44:38.320 --> 44:39.440
I'll buy all of them for you.

44:40.280 --> 44:42.600
You didn't see Tong Zhiyang's face.

44:42.680 --> 44:43.600
He was livid.

44:44.160 --> 44:47.360
I'm telling you, Jiang Li.
I've never felt so good.

44:50.120 --> 44:53.280
Yes, wealth is good.

44:53.360 --> 44:55.720
But he didn't realize wealth can kill too.

44:55.800 --> 44:57.280
Don't they want money?

44:57.360 --> 44:58.560
Let's give it to them.

44:59.760 --> 45:02.240
Now that they've taken the fatal tributes,

45:02.320 --> 45:03.840
they're going to get themselves killed.

45:03.920 --> 45:05.640
So the Ye family does business

45:05.720 --> 45:09.200
by not taking money we don't deserve.

45:09.760 --> 45:11.720
I'll have to trouble you
to deal with them next.

45:11.800 --> 45:14.920
If Tong Zhiyang wants to clear his name
with the Surveillance Commissioner,

45:15.000 --> 45:17.080
he must help the Ye family
clarify that we were set up

45:17.160 --> 45:18.240
for the Soochow brocades,

45:18.760 --> 45:19.840
then release Shun.

45:19.920 --> 45:21.840
But if we spare them,

45:21.920 --> 45:24.320
won't they cause trouble in the future?

45:24.400 --> 45:25.600
He won't stand a chance.

45:27.080 --> 45:28.600
If he has different ideas,

45:28.680 --> 45:30.600
at least Li Zhongnan won't let him

45:30.680 --> 45:32.280
continue being Luyang's governor.

45:32.840 --> 45:33.680
Wonderful.

45:34.400 --> 45:37.000
Won't we be
killing two birds with one stone?

45:40.120 --> 45:40.960
Uncle Mingyu.

45:42.040 --> 45:43.040
You even sold

45:43.120 --> 45:44.200
your escort agency

45:44.280 --> 45:45.560
for the Ye family this time.

45:46.040 --> 45:47.600
Why don't you take the chance to go home?

45:49.000 --> 45:51.600
I'm on my uppers right now.
Why go back to let them laugh at me?

45:52.280 --> 45:53.120
Take a guess

45:53.200 --> 45:55.520
at what Uncle Mingxuan said
after I told him about your help

45:55.600 --> 45:56.520
with my investigation.

45:57.120 --> 45:59.640
He must have said I couldn't carry on
with the escort agency,

45:59.720 --> 46:01.520
so I lost every penny.

46:01.600 --> 46:03.880
Uncle Mingxuan didn't say that.

46:03.960 --> 46:04.840
Uncle Mingxuan said,

46:06.440 --> 46:09.200
"Jiang Li, your third uncle

46:09.280 --> 46:10.840
may usually be unreliable,

46:11.440 --> 46:13.760
but he knows
what's right and what's wrong."

46:14.920 --> 46:16.240
He asked me to cooperate with you

46:16.320 --> 46:17.480
and even secretly asked me

46:18.040 --> 46:20.640
to give you the money he hid in his pillow

46:20.720 --> 46:23.920
if the Ye family can't get through this.

46:24.480 --> 46:25.640
He also wants me to tell you this.

46:25.720 --> 46:28.760
He said the Ye family is broke

46:28.840 --> 46:29.880
and asked you to get lost

46:29.960 --> 46:30.800
and never come back.

46:30.880 --> 46:31.840
Did he really say that?

46:32.320 --> 46:36.160
When brothers are together,
there's peace, happiness, and harmony.

46:36.720 --> 46:39.160
When brothers gather together,
there's profound peace and joy.

46:40.080 --> 46:40.920
Go home.

46:44.360 --> 46:46.600
If he really misses me that much,

46:49.160 --> 46:53.120
I'll reluctantly do them a favor

46:53.920 --> 46:57.240
and go home to take a peek at them.

47:01.320 --> 47:02.480
HELP OTHERS AND MAKE YOU
AND YOUR FAMILY HAPPY

47:02.560 --> 47:04.480
Go and switch this
to Mingxuan's favorite incense.

47:04.560 --> 47:05.800
Yes.

47:07.200 --> 47:08.640
- Wipe the table more.
- Yes.

47:08.720 --> 47:09.880
The plants will be here soon.

47:09.960 --> 47:11.040
The Four Treasures of Study.

47:11.840 --> 47:13.400
Clean them.

47:13.480 --> 47:16.280
Ms. Li, they're not aligned.

47:16.360 --> 47:17.560
No. A little lower.

47:18.120 --> 47:19.320
Yes, Madam Zhuo.

47:20.640 --> 47:22.800
She keeps repeating
the same thing over and over.

47:23.360 --> 47:25.240
Our home hasn't been this lively
in a long time.

47:25.320 --> 47:26.840
You. Straighten this up.

47:26.920 --> 47:28.600
Uncle Mingxuan is coming back today.

47:29.240 --> 47:30.280
Uncle Mingyu is home too.

47:30.800 --> 47:32.640
The Ye family will only be livelier
from now on.

47:33.200 --> 47:34.080
How nice.

47:34.680 --> 47:35.600
I used to think

47:35.680 --> 47:37.800
our days would just be ordinary.

47:37.880 --> 47:39.520
Only after this incident did I realize--

47:39.600 --> 47:40.440
Jia'er.

47:41.120 --> 47:41.960
Where's the brazier?

47:42.440 --> 47:43.440
Make a big fire.

47:44.200 --> 47:46.560
Great. I have to burn a fire now.

47:47.120 --> 47:48.840
Got it. The fire girl is coming.

47:49.560 --> 47:50.400
Good girl.

47:52.240 --> 47:54.920
Mingyu, hang the lanterns.

47:55.000 --> 47:55.840
Well…

47:55.920 --> 47:57.560
Isn't Jiang Li
not doing anything here too?

47:57.640 --> 47:58.880
Why don't you order her around?

47:59.480 --> 48:00.680
Jiang Li is different.

48:00.760 --> 48:01.960
She's the Ye family's savior.

48:02.040 --> 48:03.720
How can I bear to order her around?

48:03.800 --> 48:04.880
Go now.

48:04.960 --> 48:06.000
Stop grumbling.

48:06.480 --> 48:07.360
I'll do it.

48:07.440 --> 48:08.880
Madam Zhuo, Mr. Ye is back.

48:29.760 --> 48:32.080
- Dear!
- Mingxuan!

48:32.160 --> 48:34.160
I'm back.

48:34.760 --> 48:36.360
Stop. Start over.

48:37.680 --> 48:39.360
Where's the brazier? Bring it over.

48:39.440 --> 48:40.280
Put it here. Here.

48:40.360 --> 48:41.840
Let your father cross over it
and get rid of bad luck.

48:42.440 --> 48:43.320
Why didn't you

48:43.400 --> 48:44.680
bring it to me sooner?

48:44.760 --> 48:46.480
I have to build up my emotions again.

48:46.560 --> 48:47.720
So it's my fault?

48:47.800 --> 48:49.000
What are you doing? Hurry back.

48:51.240 --> 48:52.080
Come on.

49:00.640 --> 49:01.840
Dear!

49:01.920 --> 49:03.480
Mingxuan!

49:04.240 --> 49:05.560
Dear.

49:06.600 --> 49:07.520
I missed you so much.

49:07.600 --> 49:09.320
- I missed you more.
- I missed you even more.

49:09.400 --> 49:10.640
I missed you even more than that.

49:10.720 --> 49:12.840
- I missed you even more.
- I missed you even more.

49:12.920 --> 49:15.160
That's enough.
There are two more people here.

49:18.440 --> 49:21.920
Mingyu, you've done a great job this time.

49:23.480 --> 49:26.880
Mingxuan, don't be so polite.

49:28.120 --> 49:30.200
Mingyu, you didn't grow much

49:30.280 --> 49:32.200
after being out for so long.

49:32.280 --> 49:34.880
You're old now. Just beg for mercy
if you can't stand it.

49:34.960 --> 49:36.680
You're overestimating yourself.

49:37.320 --> 49:38.680
- Uncle Mingyu.
- Mingxuan.

49:46.040 --> 49:47.320
- Jiang Li.
- Uncle Mingxuan.

49:47.400 --> 49:49.760
You helped the Ye family a lot this time.

49:50.400 --> 49:52.560
I was even suspicious of you before.

49:53.040 --> 49:53.920
Now, it seems like

49:54.400 --> 49:57.000
I've been petty.

49:57.080 --> 49:58.440
Please accept my apology.

49:58.520 --> 50:00.280
Uncle Mingxuan, please don't.

50:00.360 --> 50:01.960
If my mother were still around,

50:02.480 --> 50:03.880
when the Ye family was in trouble,

50:03.960 --> 50:05.480
she wouldn't stand by and watch either.

50:05.560 --> 50:08.400
But even though we settled
the problem this time,

50:08.480 --> 50:09.760
the Ye family also

50:09.840 --> 50:11.800
lost a lot of money and jewelry.

50:11.880 --> 50:14.840
His Majesty valued Shijie and gave him
an official position in the capital.

50:14.920 --> 50:17.520
The jewelry can be considered
a tribute from the Ye family.

50:17.600 --> 50:18.680
Don't worry about it.

50:19.960 --> 50:22.560
I was young

50:23.880 --> 50:25.080
and was tricked by people.

50:25.760 --> 50:27.440
I broke Grandmother and my uncles' hearts.

50:28.600 --> 50:31.360
I'm still ashamed even now.

50:31.440 --> 50:32.840
Uncle Mingxuan, Aunt Zhuo,

50:33.520 --> 50:35.640
I'm so grateful
that you're willing to give me a chance

50:35.720 --> 50:36.920
to make it up to you.

50:37.000 --> 50:38.720
We can't blame you
for what happened before.

50:38.800 --> 50:40.680
You were so young.

50:40.760 --> 50:42.960
As elders,
we should've understood your situation.

50:43.920 --> 50:45.120
Now that I think about it,

50:45.200 --> 50:48.280
we made you navigate the complexities
of the Jiang family at such a young age.

50:48.360 --> 50:50.040
Especially Ji Shuran. I…

50:53.640 --> 50:56.240
I didn't mean to bring up what upsets you.

50:56.800 --> 50:58.760
In the time I've spent
with Jiang Li these days,

50:58.840 --> 51:00.680
I only think she's gentle and lovely.

51:00.760 --> 51:02.800
She won't commit matricide and fratricide.

51:02.880 --> 51:04.160
Ji Shuran must have set her up.

51:04.240 --> 51:05.080
Jia'er.

51:05.560 --> 51:06.760
It's all right, Aunt Zhuo.

51:07.920 --> 51:10.280
Who was right and who was wrong
is already in the past.

51:10.360 --> 51:12.400
What matters most is the present.

51:14.200 --> 51:15.360
The top priority

51:15.440 --> 51:16.920
is for Jiang Li to meet Mother.

51:17.000 --> 51:18.880
Yes, Jiang Li should meet Grandmother.

51:19.560 --> 51:20.440
Now?

51:20.520 --> 51:23.160
Can Grandmother take it?

51:23.240 --> 51:25.600
I can't take it that you're only

51:25.680 --> 51:27.400
telling me about this now.

51:27.480 --> 51:28.360
- Grandmother.
- Mother.

51:30.240 --> 51:32.200
Grandmother, what are you doing here?

51:34.080 --> 51:35.040
Good girl.

51:36.840 --> 51:38.400
Let me look at you.

51:38.480 --> 51:39.800
Grandmother.

51:44.760 --> 51:48.360
I'm so happy that you can visit me

51:49.280 --> 51:51.600
while I'm still alive.

51:53.360 --> 51:57.080
Grandmother, don't you blame me
for what I did before?

51:57.640 --> 52:02.600
You're the Ye family's
granddaughter, Jiang Li.

52:10.040 --> 52:13.960
Jiang Li, don't worry.
The Ye family forgives you.

52:15.720 --> 52:18.240
It's not that no one loves Ms. Jiang Li.

52:21.360 --> 52:23.240
Other than your mother, Ye Zhenzhen,

52:24.320 --> 52:27.880
you have so many loved ones
who care about you.

52:29.760 --> 52:30.600
You're not alone.

52:38.080 --> 52:39.080
And you.

52:39.160 --> 52:40.640
Have you messed around enough outside?

52:40.720 --> 52:41.800
Since you're back,

52:42.600 --> 52:43.880
help your brother out,

52:44.600 --> 52:45.760
just like this time.

52:46.400 --> 52:50.840
Brothers can overcome any difficulties
when you work together.

52:51.600 --> 52:52.480
Mother.

52:54.960 --> 52:58.280
Son, come back if you're tired.

52:58.360 --> 53:02.000
I'm always at home waiting for you.

53:05.640 --> 53:07.400
Mother, this…

53:09.200 --> 53:10.240
This is Mingxuan's fault.

53:10.800 --> 53:12.120
He refused to lend me money.

53:12.200 --> 53:13.520
If he had lent me money,

53:13.600 --> 53:15.640
I would've come back
after settling my affairs.

53:16.120 --> 53:18.880
Mingyu, don't think I'm scared to beat you
since Mother is here.

53:18.960 --> 53:20.600
I think you need a beating.

53:20.680 --> 53:23.360
You haven't come back for years.
Have you had too much fun out there?

53:23.440 --> 53:24.280
Stand still.

53:24.760 --> 53:26.640
- You. Stand there.
- You can't get me.

53:26.720 --> 53:28.120
- You can't get me.
- How dare you run?

53:28.640 --> 53:30.320
- Mother, save me.
- Stop.

53:30.800 --> 53:31.880
- Mingxuan.
- How dare you run?

53:32.440 --> 53:34.280
- Mother, don't protect him.
- Mother.

53:36.720 --> 53:38.640
If Father and Xue Zhao were still around,

53:39.440 --> 53:41.160
they'd probably also forgive me

53:41.800 --> 53:43.720
for trusting the wrong person,
wouldn't they?

53:50.080 --> 53:53.680
It's a pity that the people
who can forgive me

53:53.760 --> 53:55.160
are gone.

53:59.960 --> 54:04.000
Jiang Li, stop crying. You're home.

54:06.040 --> 54:07.520
I'm home.
